flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Read or define sample data]
    B --> C{Input and records valid?}
    C -->|Yes| D[Process data using loops and calculations]
    C -->|No| E[Display validation message]
    D --> F[Apply conditions and business rules]
    F --> G[Calculate results and summaries]
    G --> H[Display report]
    E --> H
    H --> I([End])
